00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.570
So a DD stands for due diligence.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.500
So what this means is that
if somebody wants to buy

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.210
a company, you need to do
the due diligence, right?

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.960
You need to check the company,
you need to look into it,

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.620
look into all the books and so on.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.580
And the reason why DD's are so stressful

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.610
are for two reasons.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:33.550
So first they're often in a
very short amount of time.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.330
So typically DD goes on for
two or three or four weeks.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.780
There are some lots of things
that need to be accomplished

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.950
in the short amount of time.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.270
And then second, the clients you work for

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.000
are you really super professional

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.640
and also used to work a lot.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.740
So if you get staffed on a
DD, yes you might learn a lot,

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:50.840
it might still be very interesting

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.540
but be aware that in terms of lifestyle

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.670
it can be one of the most horrible things

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:56.503
